        "en": "Before a birthday, *co mu kupić?* (what shall we buy him?) or *co jej kupić?* The present goes *dla* someone: *dla niego*, *dla niej*, *dla mamy*. A record is *płyta*, a T-shirt *koszulka*, a fridge magnet *magnes*, and an audiobook *książka do słuchania*. For someone who loves folk art, *haftowana bluzka*, a traditional embroidered top."
